ns = [...]` historically; newer recommends setReactionsAsync. Let me try setReactionsAsync first.\n\nFor SCROLL_TO: action = { type: 'NODE', destinationId: section.id, navigation: 'SCROLL_TO', transition: null, preserveScrollPosition: false, overlayRelativePosition: null, resetVideoPosition: false, resetScrollPosition: false }. Actually the Reaction type: {trigger, actions}. Each action: {type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation, transition, preserveScrollPosition, ...}.\n\nNav mapping:\n- Home → Section / Hero (top)\n- Projects → Section / Projects\n- Experience → Section / Experience\n- Contact → Contact Section instance (15:25 instance inside home)\n\nAdd reactions on the nav item instances inside Header component (15:2): children of the Nav frame. That makes the prototype work from the header.\n\nLet me implement.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcabb8c3-59d8-498d-9399-29c448a10028","uuid":"5b514f12-c400-43cb-8c9d-407e63978574","timestamp":"2026-11-02T03:29:10.968Z","thinking_duration_ms":11942}
