{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":104545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041b6ae807ac0a7a311c6c66f1a49204","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"01_Home is back in workspace and looks complete. The design is finished:\n\n- Header with Logo_ABM, nav (Home current), Get In Touch CTA\n- Hero with headline, subtext, Get In Touch + Download CV buttons, circular avatar with orange ring + blue/orange accent blobs\n- Tech stack: \"EXPERIENCE WITH\" + 5 logos (JS, Next.js, HTML5, CSS3, React)\n- Projects: 2 cards with photos, \"CLICK HERE TO VISIT\", titles, orange arrows\n- Experience: 3 entries with initials marks (S highlighted orange for current), roles, dates, descriptions\n- Contact: title, description, email pill with mail icon, 3 social buttons, bottom bar with logo\n\nPrototype: nav scroll-to, Get In Touch scroll-to, cards → URLs, email → mailto, socials → URLs.\n\nOne thing: since home moved pages, the reactions should still be intact (they reference node IDs within the same frame). Let me quickly verify reactions still exist, then finalize.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcabb8c3-59d8-498d-9399-29c448a10028","uuid":"57c08bbb-8a83-43c4-9e95-0967f545f03d","timestamp":"2026-11-02T03:47:20.494Z","thinking_duration_ms":4413}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":104545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041b6ae807ac0a7a311c6c66f1a49204","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_119_176c779e","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst home = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('16:2');\nconst headerInst = home.findOne(n => n.name === 'Header');\nconst nav = headerInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'Nav');\nconst out = {\n  nav: nav.children.map(item => ({label: item.findOne(n => n.type === 'TEXT').characters, reactions: item.reactions.length})),\n};\nconst hero = home.findOne(n => n.name === 'Section / Hero');\nconst ctaRow = hero.findOne(n => n.name === 'CTA row');\nout.getInTouch = ctaRow.children[0].reactions.length;\nconst cardsRow = home.findOne(n => n.name === 'Section / Projects').findOne(n => n.name === 'Cards row');\nout.cards = cardsRow.children.map(c => c.reactions.length);\nconst footerInst = home.children.find(c => c.name === 'Contact Section');\nout.email = footerInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'Email pill').reactions.length;\nout.socials = footerInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'Social row').children.map(s => s.reactions.length);\nreturn out;\n","description":"Verify all prototype reactions survived the page move","fileKey":"7Jay53n2t4eIv7n3PmNRTh"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcabb8c3-59d8-498d-9399-29c448a10028","uuid":"8c4fb2a3-1e6c-47fd-959f-27ba58374181","timestamp":"2026-11-02T03:47:24.269Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_119_176c779e","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
